sisted · STP off · payments on with human token&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:3px;vertical-align:top;background:#f3f6f9;&quot;&gt;Adjuster approves every claim&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:3px;vertical-align:top;background:#f3f6f9;&quot;&gt;Override &amp;lt; 15%; zero control breaches&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:3px;vertical-align:top;background:#f3f6f9;&quot;&gt;Head of Claims + Claims Ops Lead · standard change&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:3px;vertical-align:top;background:#ffffff;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Full (% rollout)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:3px;vertical-align:top;background:#ffffff;&quot;&gt;mode=full · STP on (row 1) · 10 → 25 → 50 → 100%&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:3px;vertical-align:top;background:#ffffff;&quot;&gt;STP for row-1 claims ≤ USD 1,000&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:3px;vertical-align:top;background:#ffffff;&quot;&gt;G6 hypercare criteria over 30 days&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:3px;vertical-align:top;background:#ffffff;&quot;&gt;Head of Claims · G6&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:3px;vertical-align:top;background:#f3f6f9;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Kill switch (any time)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:3px;vertical-align:top;background:#f3f6f9;&quot;&gt;kill_switch=true&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:3px;vertical-align:top;background:#f3f6f9;&quot;&gt;All claims → manual queue&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:3px;vertical-align:top;background:#f3f6f9;&quot;&gt;Incident resolved + RCA&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:3px;vertical-align:top;background:#f3f6f9;&quot;&gt;SRE on-call or automatic on Sev1 · ServiceNow incident&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" vertex="1">
